      "writtenOn": "2023-09-26T22:17:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This public interface is doing too much work and relies too much on globals.  Expand the API space to smaller pieces that can be combined as needed by the caller.  This file shouldn\u0027t need to check the flags sent by the host utility (CMD_ERASE, CMD_PARTIAL_ERASE, etc).\n\nFor instance:\n```\nspi_flash_init()\nspi_flash_read_id(*out_id)\nspi_flash_erase(start, length)\nspi_flash_program(start, length, *write_data, bool verify)\n\n```",
